"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"EBV-Related DC Vaccine Therapy\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><section class=\"relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1B4D3E] via-[#2E7D5A] to-[#1B4D3E] text-white py-20\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?w=1920&amp;q=80')] opacity-10 bg-cover bg-center\"></div><div class=\"container-custom relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg><span>精准肿瘤治疗</span></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight\">EBV相关血液肿瘤DC疫苗治疗</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/90 mb-8\">唤醒自身免疫，精准剿灭EBV驱动性血液肿瘤</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><button class=\"bg-white text-[#1B4D3E] px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white/90 transition-all\">预约咨询</button><button class=\"border-2 border-white text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all\">了解治疗流程</button></div></div></div></section><div class=\"bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-[72px] z-40\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-6 py-4 text-sm\"><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">简介</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">核心优势</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">适应症</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">治疗流程</button><button class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium transition-colors\">疗效数据</button></div></div></div><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8 text-center\">什么是EBV相关DC疫苗治疗？</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm\"><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">EB病毒（Epstein-Barr Virus, EBV）是全球首个被确认的人类肿瘤相关病毒，全球每年约有<span class=\"font-semibold text-[#1B4D3E]\">20万癌症病例</span>由EBV感染引起。</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#1B4D3E]\">KSD-101</span>是一款全球首创（First-in-class）的自体树突状细胞（Dendritic Cell, DC）疫苗，专为EBV相关血液肿瘤开发。</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">KSD-101是中国首个获得美国FDA IND批件、中国首个获得FDA快速通道资格（FTD）认定的原创树突细胞疫苗（DC疫苗）产品。2026年，该产品进一步获得美国FDA再生医学先进疗法（RMAT）认定，用于治疗复发或难治性EBV阳性淋巴瘤。</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"advantages\" class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">核心优势 – 为什么选择在中国接受DC疫苗治疗？</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">全球首创技术，中美双批认可</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">KSD-101是全球首个靶向EBV广谱的DC疫苗，同时获中国NMPA临床试验默示许可和美国FDA IND批件、FTD认定及RMAT认定，国际权威认可程度行业领先</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up \"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">突破性临床疗效</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">临床研究数据显示，客观缓解率（ORR）高达91.67%，完全缓解率（CR）83.33%，疾病控制率（DCR）100%，疗效令人瞩目</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">安全性卓越</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">不良反应以轻度为主（注射部位反应、发热、淋巴结肿大），均为1-2级，未观察到≥3级毒性和剂量限制性毒性（DLT）</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-syringe \"><path d=\"m18 2 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m17 7 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M19 9 8.7 19.3c-1 1-2.5 1-3.4 0l-.6-.6c-1-1-1-2.5 0-3.4L15 5\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m5 19-3 3\"></path><path d=\"m14 4 6 6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">给药便捷，无需清淋</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">采用皮下注射方式给药，每2周一次，全程3-5次，患者耐受性好、依从性高；无需预处理淋巴细胞清除，无需预防性用药，治疗流程简化</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">突破HLA限制，广谱适用</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">突破传统免疫疗法在HLA配型和抗原谱狭窄上的局限，可有效呈递LMP2、EBNA1等多重病毒表位，显著拓宽免疫识别范围</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap \"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">双重治疗作用</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">同时发挥抗病毒和抗肿瘤双重治疗作用，既能清除病毒感染的肿瘤细胞，又能重建持久的免疫记忆预防复发</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-2xl p-8 card-hover\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin \"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">海南博鳌先行区优势</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">依托乐城\"先行先试\"政策，KSD-101已落地瑞金医院海南医院，可为符合条件的患者提供这一全球领先的治疗技术</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"indications\" class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">适应症</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">KSD-101主要适用于经标准治疗无效或复发的EBV相关血液肿瘤患者。目前已获临床研究验证的亚型包括：</p><ul class=\"space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">EBV阳性弥漫大B细胞淋巴瘤（EBV+DLBCL）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">EBV相关NK/T细胞淋巴瘤（NKTCL，鼻型/外周型）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">霍奇金淋巴瘤（HL，EBV阳性）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">血管免疫母细胞性T细胞淋巴瘤（AITL）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">慢性活动性EB病毒感染（CAEBV）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">EBV相关噬血细胞性淋巴组织细胞增多症（EBV-HLH）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">EBV阳性结节性T滤泡辅助细胞淋巴瘤（nTFHL-AI型）</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-[#1B4D3E] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-700\">Burkitt淋巴瘤（BL，EBV阳性）</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">评估说明</h2><p class=\"text-white/90 leading-relaxed mb-6\">是否适合接受DC疫苗治疗，需由多学科专家团队进行全面个体化评估。研究提示对传统化疗耐受性差的患者可能获益更多。</p><div class=\"bg-white/10 rounded-xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-4\">治疗特点</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#7CB342] rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-2\"></div><span class=\"text-white/90\">自体细胞治疗，安全性高</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#7CB342] rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-2\"></div><span class=\"text-white/90\">无需清淋预处理</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#7CB342] rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-2\"></div><span class=\"text-white/90\">皮下注射，操作简便</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-[#7CB342] rounded-full flex-shrink-0 mt-2\"></div><span class=\"text-white/90\">门诊即可完成后续注射</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">治疗内容</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">DC疫苗治疗包含以下核心环节</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl p-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">多学科团队评估与筛选</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">由血液肿瘤学专家、免疫学专家等组成MDT团队，全面评估患者EBV感染状态、肿瘤特征和治疗适应证</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl p-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">单核细胞采集</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">通过白细胞分离术从患者外周血中采集足量单核细胞，送往GMP认证实验室进行后续制备</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl p-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">DC疫苗个性化制备</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">在GMP认证实验室中，将采集的单核细胞体外诱导分化为树突状细胞，并负载EBV特异性复合抗原，制备成个体化治疗性疫苗</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl p-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">DC疫苗皮下注射</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">制备完成的疫苗以皮下注射方式回输至患者体内，每次注射后密切观察反应。全程无需淋巴细胞清除预处理，无需预防性用药</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl p-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">定期随访与免疫监测</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">治疗后定期随访，检测EBV DNA水平和免疫应答情况，评估疗效和安全性</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">治疗流程</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">从初诊至康复约2-3个月</p></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">1</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">远程咨询与初筛</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2-5天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">提交病历资料，多学科专家团队远程评估是否符合DC疫苗治疗指征</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">2</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">签证与行程安排</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1-2周</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">医疗签证邀请函、国际保险对接、行程规划与住宿安排</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">3</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">抵华与全面评估</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2-3天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">全面身体检查、EBV DNA检测、免疫学功能评估、肿瘤负荷评估</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">4</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">单核细胞采集</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">白细胞分离术采集患者外周血单核细胞</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">5</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">DC疫苗制备</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2-3周</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">在GMP实验室进行树突状细胞诱导分化及EBV抗原负载</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">6</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">皮下注射治疗</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">6-10周</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">每2周皮下注射一次，全程3-5次注射</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">7</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">住院监测与出院</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">3-7天（首次注射后）</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">首次注射后短期住院密切监测，后续注射可在门诊完成</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-8 last:mb-0\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\">8</div><div class=\"flex-grow bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">长期随访管理</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">持续</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">定期复查、远程随访、免疫应答监测</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 text-center\"><p class=\"text-gray-600\">从抵华至完成全部注射治疗，全程通常需要<span class=\"font-semibold text-[#1B4D3E]\">8-12周</span>，相比传统放化疗周期更短、便利性更高。</p></div></div></section><section id=\"efficacy\" class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">疗效数据</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">核心疗效数据一览（2025年EHA公布最新数据）</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><p class=\"text-white/70 mb-2\">客观缓解率（ORR）</p><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-2\">91.67%</p><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">多线复发难治EBV相关血液肿瘤患者</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><p class=\"text-white/70 mb-2\">完全缓解率（CR）</p><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-2\">83.33%</p><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">多线复发难治EBV相关血液肿瘤患者</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><p class=\"text-white/70 mb-2\">疾病控制率（DCR）</p><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-2\">100%</p><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">多线复发难治EBV相关血液肿瘤患者</p></div><div class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><p class=\"text-white/70 mb-2\">中位随访</p><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-2\">42.7周</p><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">大部分患者达到完全缓解（CR）并得以维持</p></div></div><div class=\"text-center mb-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8\">安全性数据</h3></div><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><thead class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white\"><tr><th class=\"px-6 py-4 text-left font-semibold\">不良反应类型</th><th class=\"px-6 py-4 text-left font-semibold\">发生率</th><th class=\"px-6 py-4 text-left font-semibold\">严重程度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"bg-white\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-700\">注射部位反应</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-[#1B4D3E] font-semibold\">约91%</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-600\">1级，轻度</td></tr><tr class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-700\">发热</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-[#1B4D3E] font-semibold\">可发生</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-600\">≤2级，轻中度</td></tr><tr class=\"bg-white\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-700\">淋巴结肿大</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-[#1B4D3E] font-semibold\">可发生</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-600\">1级，轻度</td></tr><tr class=\"bg-[#F5F7FA]\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-700\">≥3级毒性</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-[#1B4D3E] font-semibold\">0%</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-600\">未观察到</td></tr><tr class=\"bg-white\"><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-700\">剂量限制性毒性（DLT）</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-[#1B4D3E] font-semibold\">0%</td><td class=\"px-6 py-4 text-gray-600\">未观察到</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">参考治疗费用</h2><div class=\"bg-[#1B4D3E] rounded-2xl p-8 text-white\"><p class=\"text-lg mb-4\">全疗程治疗费用约在</p><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5